<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech November jobless rate edges up to 3.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech November jobless rate edges up to 3.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in the Czech Republic in November was 175,842, or 3.3 percent of the workforce, the Ministry of Labour and Social Affairs said on Monday.</p>
<p>In October, the Czech jobless rate stood at 3.23 percent.  </p>
<p> CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT     NOV 96	OCT 96	NOV 95</p>
<p>  number of jobless    175,842     170,471     148,042</p>
<p>  pct of workforce	 3.30	  3.23	  2.80</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
